OL,3,GNEWSADog walker dies after being hit by
OL,4,Afarm trailer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog walker has died after being
OL,7,Fstruck by a farm trailer as it passed
OL,8,Fhim from behind.
OL,10,FIt happened at about 10:50 BST on
OL,11,FSaturday along the B4196 in Shrawley,
OL,12,Fnear Droitwich, in Worcestershire.
OL,14,FWest Mercia Police said the 82-year-old
OL,15,Fman suffered a "significant head
OL,16,Finjury" and was taken to the Queen
OL,17,FElizabeth Hospital in Birmingham. He
OL,18,Flater died as a result of his injuries.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
